==Introduction==

===Abstract===

This document proposes a family of codex32 human-readable parts (HRPs) for the key material that appears in a
[https://github.com/bitcoin/bips/blob/master/bip-0380.mediawiki BIP-0380] descriptor <code>KEY</code> expression:
public keys, x-only public keys, WIF-equivalent private keys, and BIP-0032 extended keys. It depends on
[https://github.com/bitcoin/bips/pull/2040 the codex32 HRP generalization], since each type below needs its own HRP
rather than the fixed "ms" BIP-0093 currently requires.

This is a concept-stage draft: naming and two specific open questions (below) are unresolved, and no test vectors
have been written yet. It is being circulated for feedback before either is finalized.

